players.script:
# ducker.pf — low profile.
# Strategy: stay ducked so grounded high attacks (punch, kick) whiff, jab
# from the duck when the enemy is close, and sweep enemies that walk into
# range. Weak to jump attacks (overheads hit a ducking fighter) and throws.
loop {
  if in_range(low_jab) {
    duck hold 12
    punch
    punch
  } elif in_range(sweep) {
    sweep
  } else {
    duck hold 8
  }
}

# jumper.pf — air assault.
# Strategy: walk in, then jump forward and kick late in the jump. A kick
# started on airborne frames 17-20 is a landing low: it carries through
# touchdown, hits ducking fighters and goes under a high_block, so it must be
# blocked low. It loses to fighters who poke it out of the air with quick
# grounded attacks: any hit on an airborne fighter knocks it down.
loop {
  if distance > 24 {
    move_forward x5
  } else {
    jump_forward
    wait 15
    kick
  }
}
on_hit { move_back x2 }
